# CountryApi — com.asrevo.cvhome.checkout.api.v1.reference.CountryApi
#
# Public. The ISO country list from the JDK, named in the request language; `zones` is always empty (states and
# provinces are free text on an address now).
#
# Requires a running stack: lcl start -d

### in English
GET {{SPG_URL}}/checkout/api/v1/country?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang=en

### in French
GET {{SPG_URL}}/checkout/api/v1/country?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang=fr
